-- INDEPENDENT TESTS. Expected values were decided from BRIEF.md and inputs/
-- alone, before any .l4 file was opened (expectations recorded separately,
-- with the provision each comes from). A failing assertion here is a finding;
-- expected values have not been changed to match the code.
--
-- Calendar facts (checked with `date`, not computed by the encoding):
-- 2026-10-03 Sat, 2026-10-05 Mon, 2026-10-08 Thu, 2026-10-10 Sat,
-- 2026-10-31 Sat, 2026-11-02 Mon, 2026-12-18 Fri, 2026-12-23 Wed,
-- 2026-12-25 Fri, 2026-12-28 Mon, 2027-10-01 Fri, 2027-10-02 Sat, 2027-10-04 Mon.
-- Holiday input: Christmas Day 2026 and the Boxing Day substitute 28 Dec 2026.

§ `Independent tests`

§§ `Helpers`

GIVETH A LIST OF DATE
`xmas 2026` MEANS LIST YMD 2026 12 25, YMD 2026 12 28

GIVEN name IS A STRING
      dob IS A DATE
      resident IS A DATE
      convs IS A LIST OF Conviction
      notices IS A LIST OF `Infringement notice record`
      pensioner IS A BOOLEAN
      members IS A LIST OF `Cat fancy body`
      approved IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Person
mkperson name dob resident convs notices pensioner members approved MEANS
    Person OF name, dob, EMPTY, resident, convs, notices, pensioner, members, FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, approved

GIVEN dob IS A DATE
      keepings IS A LIST OF Keeping
      reg IS A MAYBE Registration
      dev IS A MAYBE `Implanted device`
      sp IS A MAYBE `Sterilising procedure`
      cc IS A MAYBE `Veterinary certificate`
      cs IS A MAYBE `Veterinary certificate`
      cust IS A MAYBE Custodian
      fp IS A MAYBE `Foster placement`
      breeding IS A BOOLEAN
      death IS A MAYBE DATE
      instate IS A BOOLEAN
      another IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Cat
mkcat dob keepings reg dev sp cc cs cust fp breeding death instate another MEANS
    Cat OF "Tom", dob, "City of Perth", instate, death, reg, another, dev, sp, cc, cs, keepings, NOTHING, cust, fp, breeding, FALSE

`chip` MEANS JUST (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2024 3 1))
`desex` MEANS JUST (`a desexing by a vet on` (YMD 2024 3 1))
`adult dob` MEANS YMD 2024 1 1
`Alex since 2024` MEANS LIST (`kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1))

-- An adult cat kept by Alex since 2024, unregistered, with the custodian / foster placement given.
GIVEN cust IS A MAYBE Custodian
      fp IS A MAYBE `Foster placement`
GIVETH A Cat
`Alex's adult cat in` cust `foster` fp MEANS
    mkcat `adult dob` `Alex since 2024` NOTHING `chip` `desex` NOTHING NOTHING cust fp FALSE NOTHING TRUE FALSE

`plain cat` MEANS `Alex's adult cat in` NOTHING `foster` NOTHING

GIVEN p IS A Person
      g IS A `Grant or renewal`
      t IS A `Registration term`
      dm IS A DATE
      dd IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Registration application`
regapp p g t dm dd MEANS `Registration application` OF p, g, t, dm, dd

GIVEN d IS A `Registration determination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `must refuse` d IF
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the local government must refuse the application` g THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN d IS A `Registration determination`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`reg grounds` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the local government must refuse the application` g THEN count g
    OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN d IS A `Registration determination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `must grant` d IF
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the local government must grant or renew the registration` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN d IS A `Registration determination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may refuse to consider reg` d IF
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the local government may refuse to consider the application` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN app IS A `Registration application`
      cat IS A Cat
      people IS A LIST OF Person
GIVETH A `Registration determination`
s9 app cat people MEANS `the s 9 determination of` app `for` cat `, its owners among` people `, after the request` NOTHING

GIVEN b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Breeding application findings`
findings b c e MEANS `Breeding application findings` OF b, c, e

`no findings` MEANS findings FALSE FALSE FALSE

GIVEN p IS A Person
      n IS A NUMBER
      f IS A `Breeding application findings`
GIVETH A `Breeding application`
breedapp p n f MEANS `Breeding application` OF p, `a grant`, YMD 2026 10 5, YMD 2026 10 5, n, f

GIVEN d IS A `Breeding approval determination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may refuse breeding` d IF
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the local government may refuse the application` g THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN d IS A `Breeding approval determination`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`breeding grounds` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the local government may refuse the application` g THEN count g
    OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN d IS A `Breeding approval determination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is to grant breeding` d IF
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the local government is to grant or renew the approval` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN d IS A `Breeding approval determination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `not to refuse breeding` d IF
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the local government is not to refuse the application` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN d IS A `Breeding approval determination`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may defer breeding` d IF
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the local government may defer consideration until the infringement notice is resolved` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN app IS A `Breeding application`
GIVETH A `Breeding approval determination`
s37 app MEANS `the s 37 determination of` app `, after the request` NOTHING

GIVEN m IS A MAYBE `Review window`
GIVETH A DATE
`first of` m MEANS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN JUST w THEN w's `first day`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN YMD 1900 1 1

GIVEN m IS A MAYBE `Review window`
GIVETH A DATE
`last of` m MEANS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN JUST w THEN w's `last day`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN YMD 1900 1 1

