§§ `B. Schedule 3 fees`

-- item 1(a): grant, 1 year, made after 31 May
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (regapp `Adult` `a grant` `one year` (YMD 2026 6 1) (YMD 2026 6 1)) EQUALS 10
-- item 1(b): made on 31 May is not "after 31 May"
