#ASSERT `the breeding approval fee payable for` (breedapp `Adult` 3 `no findings`) EQUALS 300
#ASSERT `the breeding approval fee payable for` (breedapp `Adult` 1 `no findings`) EQUALS 100
-- cl 1(3) pensioner: 50% of the registration fee
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (regapp `Pensioner` `a renewal` `one year` (YMD 2026 1 10) (YMD 2026 1 10)) EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (regapp `Pensioner` `a grant` `one year` (YMD 2026 6 1) (YMD 2026 6 1)) EQUALS 5
